     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Price and quantities",
     "texto": [
      "**Ne kadar?** means «how much does it cost?» or «how much?»; **kaç lira?** asks the price in lira.",
      "**Bir kilo elma** = a kilo of apples; **yarım kilo** = half a kilo. After a quantity, the noun stays singular.",
      "**Alıyorum** = I buy / I am buying. **Pahalı** means expensive and **ucuz** means cheap."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
